      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}\n\ni'll note for this that Quest Standalone seems to have the same gesture-matching feature missing, with the following distinction:\n\n- Quest defaults to Idle Hand gesture (0) when in Hand Tracking.\n\n- Pico defaults to Open Hand gesture (2) when in Hand Tracking.\n\nIn the image, Blue is a Quest 3 user, while Purple is a Pico 4 user. The labels are for the viewpoints.",
