  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "On PICO standalone, hand tracking does not use gesture matching.\n\nOn PCVR, hand tracking is matched with the standard VRChat gestures similar to Index Knuckles, triggering the avatar Gesture parameters.\n\nSimply, PICO standalone hand tracking cannot perform avatar gestures.",
